  "abstract": "Presents a minimal three-term Lagrangian for a discrete grid coupled to gravity via a gradient interaction |\u2207\u03a6|(\u2207\u03be)\u00b2. The coupling yields a position-dependent stiffness \u03ba_eff = \u03ba0 + \u03b1 g and a local dispersion relation that, in the gravitational regime, implies E = \u210f\u03c9 \u221d \u221ag, deriving the EFC screening relation from first principles and establishing operator uniqueness within a defined class.",
